    rdfs:comment "As stated in the running header of section P1 of the 2026 Prohibited List: PROHIBITED IN PARTICULAR SPORTS. The sports are named in the section and carried by sportScope."@en ;
    adro:definedIn adro:Entry_2026_S0 .

